<title>CHINA: China's coal Jan-Nov imports soar by 108.7 pct.</title>
<headline>China's coal Jan-Nov imports soar by 108.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's imports of coal soared 108.7 percent in the first 11 months of 1996 to 2.84 million tonnes compared with 1.36 million tonnes in the year-ago period, customs figures showed on Monday.</p>
<p>Imports in November alone were 160,000 tonnes, the figures showed.</p>
<p>China's coal exports were 25.04 million tonnes in the first 11 months, down by 1.2 percent from 25.35 million tonnes in the year-ago period, the figures showed.</p>
<p>Exports in November alone were 1.74 million tonnes, the figures showed.</p>
</text>
